on’s hideout</li>\n<li>Checkanaya 15</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Whitelisted Rounds</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>12/70 AP-20 Slug</li>\n<li>TSS Slug</li>\n<li>Dangerous Game Slug</li>\n</ul>\n", "versions": [{"version": "2.0.0", "spt_version_constraint": "4.0.4", "content_length": 2230885, "downloads": 991, "published_at": "2025-11-13T09:00:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2443/backdoor-bandit-ng/2.0.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "compatible", "dependencies": [{"id": 2310, "name": "WTT - CommonLib", "slug": "wtt-commonlib", "status": "ok"}, {"id": 2326, "name": "Project Fika", "slug": "project-fika", "status": "ok"}]}, {"version": "2.0.1", "spt_version_constraint": "4.0.4", "content_length": 2229387, "downloads": 1206, "published_at": "2025-11-15T16:29:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2443/backdoor-bandit-ng/2.0.1", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "compatible", "dependencies": [{"id": 2310, "name": "WTT - CommonLib", "slug": "wtt-commonlib", "status": "ok"}]}, {"version": "2.0.2", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.0.0", "content_length": 2218901, "downloads": 1676, "published_at": "2025-11-19T20:23:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2443/backdoor-bandit-ng/2.0.2", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "compatible", "dependencies": [{"id": 2310, "name": "WTT - CommonLib", "slug": "wtt-commonlib", "status": "ok"}]}, {"version": "2.0.3", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.0.0", "content_length": 2219969, "downloads": 5649, "published_at": "2025-11-26T16:23:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2443/backdoor-bandit-ng/2.0.3", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "compatible", "dependencies": [{"id": 2310, "name": "WTT - CommonLib", "slug": "wtt-commonlib